  "details": "Hey,\nI've been working on my world lately and after some testing in desktop mode and VR mode I realized that some of my VRC_Triggers don't appear to work for in Desktop mode while they work totally fine in VR. I haven't changed any of the triggers settings except what it does (toggle gameobjects LOCALLY). \nThey are all on normal meshes with a box collider on them so that in theory there is nothing that should cause them to not work. \n\nThese objects simply don't popup as interactable to desktop users.\n\nAm I just doing something wrong?\nI'll upload an image of my triggers inspector ASAP.\n\n\nEDIT: Seems like that it is caused by this object being inside another invisible Collider blocking the user from interacting with it.",
